# --- RESTRICTED DATA: IEEE-CIS/Vesta competition derivatives ---
# These are derived from the Kaggle IEEE-CIS Fraud Detection dataset, which
# is governed by its own competition/distribution terms and is NOT
# redistributable from this repository. Obtain the data yourself (see
# scripts/setup_data.py and README "Data availability") and keep these
# artifacts local. Exact-path rules so nothing else in data/ gets hidden.
